; TR-1um.prm -- generated by script/build_tr1um_prm.py
; DO NOT hand-edit -- regenerate instead (script/gen_prm_characterize.py
; + ngspice locally + script/build_tr1um_prm.py). See design_notes.md
; and irsim/README.md for the full derivation/methodology.
;
; Resistance table from ngspice characterization of the REAL TR-1um
; PMOS/NMOS models (~/Dropbox/91_OpenPDK/TR-1um/libs.tech/spice/models/
; ip62_models, vdd=5.0V, per IRSIM's own official calibration procedure).
; Capacitance parameters (capga/capda/cappda) computed directly from the
; same real model file's tox/cj parameters (no simulation needed).

lambda 1.0

capga 0.001771
capda 0.000744
capdp 0.0
cappda 0.001020
cappdp 0.0
; interconnect-layer caps not modeled by this flow (this project's .sim
; carries no wire/layer geometry -- see design_notes.md); set to 0.
capm2a 0.0
capm2p 0.0
capma 0.0
capmp 0.0
cappa 0.0
cappp 0.0

; diffusion extension: enables IRSIM's TDIFFCAP mechanism so per-
; transistor S/D diffusion cap is added even without explicit AS/AD in
; the .sim. Reused directly from the real model's own sdwidth=2.8u
; (models_IP62_mos_v2.lib) -- the same physical quantity its own AS/AD
; formula already assumes, not an arbitrary guess.
diffext 2.8

lowthresh 0.3
highthresh 0.8

resistance n-channel	dynamic-high	3.40	1.00	12008.0
resistance n-channel	dynamic-low	3.40	1.00	4850.0
resistance n-channel	static	3.40	1.00	5711.0
resistance p-channel	dynamic-high	10.20	1.00	3159.0
resistance p-channel	dynamic-low	10.20	1.00	10715.0
resistance p-channel	static	10.20	1.00	3650.0

resistance n-channel	dynamic-high	3.40	2.00	22023.0
resistance n-channel	dynamic-low	3.40	2.00	7641.0
resistance n-channel	static	3.40	2.00	9658.0
resistance p-channel	dynamic-high	10.20	2.00	5648.0
resistance p-channel	dynamic-low	10.20	2.00	19555.0
resistance p-channel	static	10.20	2.00	6825.0

